#ASSERT `s 839(1) an appeal to the court of appeal may be taken against the decision` `s 839(1)(a) a decision of a court in respect of an appeal under section 822` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 839(1) an appeal to the court of appeal may be taken against the decision` `s 839(1)(a) a decision of a court in respect of an appeal under section 822` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
